{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車を何駅も乗らなきゃいけないときはあんまり嫌いじゃないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長い電車すきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな曲を気持ち大きめの音で聴くのがとっても幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近好きな曲をやっと思い出せて、リピート聴きしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前に聞いてた曲を聴くと何か変な感じ⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝るときにイヤホンでとっても大きい音でうるさくなってても、寝れるんですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中でうるさくなって起きるけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠りが浅いせいか、毎日夢を見ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い夢は嫌ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢占いをするのは怖いけど、気になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢で見たことが最近現実で3回くらいおこりました(*^｡^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0FK1EG36CZE8KAR8FEM6V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこやき〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"}